# Suppressing a group whole (an extension): the group screen's check box
# leaves out the shank's sketch, and with it every group that uses it,
# with nothing deleted. The group list says what is left out and why;
# a group left out can't be made active; undo brings it all back.
load thread/bolt_m8x30.slvs
tw
# The shank sketch's screen, and its check box.
twmove 145 180
twdown L 145 180
twup L 145 180
tw
twmove 28 170
twdown L 28 170
twup L 28 170
tw
dump
# Home: the shank and the thread are left out with the sketch.
twmove 28 10
twdown L 28 10
twup L 28 10
tw
# The shank can't be made active.
answer ok
twmove 28 200
twdown L 28 200
twup L 28 200
key z ctrl
tw
dump
